    "message": "Hi,\n\nHope you’re doing well.\n\nThe *Web Summit Qatar 2026 *is scheduled for *01 - 04 Feb 2026 *at the *Doha\nExhibition and Convention Center (DECC) in Doha, Qatar*.\n\nA compiled and verified list of *24,500 **registered attendees* is\navailable to help you enhance your networking and outreach efforts ahead of\nthe event.\n\nThe list features key details such as:\n\n   - Company Name,\n   - Contact Person & Role,\n   - Business Contact Information (Email, Phone, Address),\n   - Location Details.\n\nWould you like to receive additional information about this attendee list at\nan exclusive price?\n\nPlease confirm your preference:\n· Yes, I am Interested, please share pricing and details.\n· No, thank you\n\n\nThanks and Regards,\nCharles Anderson\n",
